    {
      "text": "Figure 13, 'The chain of trust'. Three linked boxes: CSCA (country signing certificate authority) and DSC (document signer certificate), each with a private and a public key, and DDCC (Digital Documentation of COVID-19 Certificate), marked with a QR code. Above, 'Signing and issuing a DDCC' runs in steps 1-3 from CSCA through DSC to DDCC. Below, a dotted 'Verifying a DDCC' arc runs in steps 1-3 the other way, from DDCC back to CSCA.",
